# Filtro del contexto (raíz del monorepo) para apps/admin-web/Dockerfile.
# BuildKit usa <Dockerfile>.dockerignore cuando existe.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
apps/*/prisma/generated
.git
.github
.husky
.changeset
.claude
docs
infrastructure
apps/web-sis
apps/promotions-service
apps/leads-service
apps/crm-bridge-service
apps/admin-web/e2e
